ss_summary":"Sealmatic India Limited designs and manufactures mechanical seals and associated products in India and internationally. It offers seal supply systems, pumps, valves, motors and high precision mechanical engineering spares, and assemblies for various machineries; and engineered mechanical, pusher, standard cartridge, elastomer bellows, metal bellows, split, gas-lubricated, and other sealing solutions. The company also provides mechanical seals for use in rotating equipment, including pumps, compressors, mixers, steam turbines, and other specialty equipment. It serves oil and gas, refinery, petrochemical, chemical, pharmaceutical, fertilizer, power, mining, pulp and paper, aerospace, marine, and other industrial applications. The company was incorporated in 2009 and is based in Thane, India."}}